.vite

# Agent tooling — keep out of the repo, except shared project skills, the
# project hooks, and the settings that register them. Those three must be
# tracked: they have to exist in every worktree checkout to take effect there.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/settings.json
CLAUDE.md
.idea/
.superpowers/
